'將支臂內力重組為基礎合力，檢查向量和與外部門體水壓是否閉合。~Reassemble arm forces into foundation resultants and check vector closure against the externally applied gate pressure.',
'比較支點轉角和壓桿側向位移的關係，以辨認實際端部是否近似鉸接或有拘束。~Compare support rotation with member lateral displacement to identify whether real ends approximate pins or restrained connections.',
'以相同水位的獨立積分重算垂直分量，確認水平投影沒有被當成全部濕潤面。~Independently integrate the vertical component at matching levels and verify that projected area is not mistaken for wetted area.',
