'對相同水頭的重複試驗比較流量斜率，並以密封接觸影像區分縫寬改變和雜物卡塞。~Compare repeated flow-head slopes at equal heads and use contact imagery to distinguish gap growth from trapped debris.',
'追查演練中兩套設備同時失去功能的事件，確認共同原因沒有被拆成兩件獨立故障。~Trace exercise events that disabled both units and ensure one common cause was not counted as two independent failures.',
'以原始量測時間重排事件，核對資料更新旗標能否辨識通訊恢復後抵達的過期讀數。~Reorder events by measurement time and verify that freshness flags identify stale readings arriving after communications recover.',
'以局部應變循環重新分箱計數，將雨流計數所得範圍與所用疲勞細節曲線一致對應。~Rebin local strain cycles and consistently match rainflow stress ranges to the selected fatigue-detail curve.'
